<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech sees more earnings growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>VA Tech sees more earnings growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian engineering group VA Technologie said on Wednesday it expected to post continued earnings growth in 1997 after a strong improvement in last year's earnings.</p>
<p>&quot;Pursuing its adopted strategy, VA Tech will further grow in business volume and earnings, paying high attention to globalisation, technological development and group integration,&quot; VA Tech said in a statement ahead of a news conference. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112256</p>
</text>
